### Medical & Clinical Disclaimer

Medtrack is designed and provided solely as an informational personal medication
and adherence management application. It is not a certified medical device and
does not provide medical diagnosis, treatment planning, prescription validation,
or clinical consultation.

Users should always verify dosages, schedules, and drug interactions with a licensed
physician, pharmacist, or healthcare provider. In the event of a medical emergency,
immediately contact your local emergency services.
